{"screen_name": "thrananaart", "file": "thrananaart", "name": "雨夜とらナナ　FANBOX開設", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498079856890085377/7yxNe6my.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1148800044818030593/1667428115/1500x500", "description": "絵を描くアカウント。ゲーム好きです、よろしくお願いしまーーす【skeb】https://skeb.jp/@thrananaart 【pixiv】http://pixiv.net/users/8062170", "total_works": 308, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-14T15:15:40.596063+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}, {"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-18T12:37:11.026064"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 13000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 13000, "max": 13000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/thrananaart", "name": "thrananaart"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://www.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/8062170", "name": "8062170"}], "works": [{"path": "/@thrananaart/works/308", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c10e96ac/uploads/origins/2b6c398e-06ab-4578-8a17-2c58453c5b0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcd099e19731ed33c8d36796a613d9bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c10e96ac/uploads/origins/2b6c398e-06ab-4578-8a17-2c58453c5b0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcd099e19731ed33c8d36796a613d9bb, https://si.imgix.net/c10e96ac/uploads/origins/2b6c398e-06ab-4578-8a17-2c58453c5b0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c321ac2c4aba9fd675124782c40ae8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c10e96ac/uploads/origins/2b6c398e-06ab-4578-8a17-2c58453c5b0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fda1157cbee4728d835c67e002da0a64 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "明けましておめでとうございます！\n今年最初のリクエストをお願いします！\n\n今回はアイドルマスターシンデレラガールズの島村卯月で、服装はエヴァ新劇場版「破」の真希波・マリ・イラストリアスのプラグスーツでお願いします。\n服装の詳細に関しては資料を参照にして頂ければと思いますが、ポーズはお任せします。\n（資料は3枚ありますが、リクエストのイラストは1枚で大丈夫です）\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qgy32WPXvt-DMb0j_wZqGxVhb5vWCljW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thrananaart/works/307", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/46801a4f/uploads/origins/aa8811fe-ba16-4190-b57e-b669a06ce097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e3636ea68e8bfe07ffa832cd6932415", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46801a4f/uploads/origins/aa8811fe-ba16-4190-b57e-b669a06ce097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e3636ea68e8bfe07ffa832cd6932415, https://si.imgix.net/46801a4f/uploads/origins/aa8811fe-ba16-4190-b57e-b669a06ce097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e756da41e4712bc670478bba653ed535 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46801a4f/uploads/origins/aa8811fe-ba16-4190-b57e-b669a06ce097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6233b24fbbfde2aa732c77ff09629fc2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thrananaart/works/306", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5232227a/uploads/origins/a152ab0c-52ff-4a69-ad07-c80ad6608bc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3565ae5d58779898604a026675719f7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5232227a/uploads/origins/a152ab0c-52ff-4a69-ad07-c80ad6608bc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3565ae5d58779898604a026675719f7, https://si.imgix.net/5232227a/uploads/origins/a152ab0c-52ff-4a69-ad07-c80ad6608bc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2384c2843786ab6359d30e2464c2a00 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5232227a/uploads/origins/a152ab0c-52ff-4a69-ad07-c80ad6608bc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cb8aed101e0b16e14b4b8a95035e031 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "雨夜とらナナ様初めまして！\n是非自分の好きなキャラでも見てみたいと思い、依頼させて頂きます\n【キャラ】 \n私のOC 紅蓮\n(頭飾り，翼省略お願いしたいです) \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QX-LQ4rx652yuvgjF4cdI8VCnFPvyni3\n【シーン】 \n私のOC 変身妨害お願いします\n\n•変身中に異次元(変身は異次元で行う設定なので)から引っ張り出され、四肢を触手拘束され、背中からアクメビームを浴びせられている状態\n•アクメビームの効果で股間からは愛液が大量に漏れ\n•衣装は変身後の衣装で、頭の部分は変身前の状態\n•変身が不完全で抵抗力が無いため\n•最後変身が解除されて全裸アヘ顔狀態\n\n描くのが難しいと感じたら断っていただいても問題ありません！\n金額の不足あれば再送頂けますと幸いです，御一考お願い致しま!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thrananaart/works/305", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8852ace/uploads/origins/d153e880-fe8a-422d-b991-8d355ff93721?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aaa6d12859f0855de6e717428504c7a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8852ace/uploads/origins/d153e880-fe8a-422d-b991-8d355ff93721?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aaa6d12859f0855de6e717428504c7a7, https://si.imgix.net/f8852ace/uploads/origins/d153e880-fe8a-422d-b991-8d355ff93721?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e7503607871f77e7af6014480550c97d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8852ace/uploads/origins/d153e880-fe8a-422d-b991-8d355ff93721?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c18bdd735a0d90ec5a5e450f811f3404 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thrananaart/works/304", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a90527aa/uploads/origins/c5f4b0ae-d17b-4fb6-ac2b-f3ea08fee142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c0505f664ae73384a99b03146aee178", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a90527aa/uploads/origins/c5f4b0ae-d17b-4fb6-ac2b-f3ea08fee142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c0505f664ae73384a99b03146aee178, https://si.imgix.net/a90527aa/uploads/origins/c5f4b0ae-d17b-4fb6-ac2b-f3ea08fee142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b90575d4081df4bbf474547fb6177654 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a90527aa/uploads/origins/c5f4b0ae-d17b-4fb6-ac2b-f3ea08fee142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32cc1a0d020e9de90726e19708c6c85b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、忙しい中毎回リクエストにお応え頂き本当にありがとうございます。\n\n現在依頼中の平沢唯✕ベジータコスプレのリクエストに続く形となってしまいますが可能でしたらお願いいたします。\n\nお題は秋山澪のベジータコスプレ（フリーザ編）です。\nこちらも唯と同じく2種類のポーズがあり、詳細は添付の資料にあります。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BTHCNiXR4syz1PCN-4fjiS03qjDo54n8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thrananaart/works/303", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/08385298/uploads/origins/ae1ee7a2-0e20-4f07-b565-f91ef7f0490d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bdc345e6b8e805b84472ef17c8ac83ba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08385298/uploads/origins/ae1ee7a2-0e20-4f07-b565-f91ef7f0490d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bdc345e6b8e805b84472ef17c8ac83ba